  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Tunkhannock 14-point Pitch. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Tunkhannock 14-point Pitch: Pitch to 14 points. Bid for trump; high low jack.',
    objective: 'Be the first to reach 14 points. Points are scored for high (highest trump in play), low (lowest trump in play), jack (jack of trumps), off-jack, high joker, low joker, game (most card points in tricks), last trick, high spade (1 each), and five of trumps (5 points). Bid to become pitcher and name trump; make your bid or be set back.',
    gameplay: 'Six cards each, dealt in two rounds of three. One round of bidding (min 3, max smudge 15); dealer may steal with equal bid and must bid 3 if all pass. After bidding, each player discards three and is replenished to six from the stock. Pitcher leads to first trick (trump need not be led). Follow suit or trump; you may trump even when holding the led suit; may only play off-suit when unable to follow. Six tricks. Points awarded to the player winning each point card in a trick; game point to most card points in tricks. First to 14 wins.',
    keyRules: [
      '14 point game',
      '54 cards with two jokers',
      'Off-jack and jokers rank as trumps below jack',
      'Bid 3 to 15 (smudge); dealer can steal',
      'Discard 3 and replenish after bidding',
